{"1-7":{"people":[{"id":"ephraim-h0669g","name":"Ephraim","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":4,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"jephthah-h3316h","name":"Jephthah","kind":"person","brief":"A Judge","count":4,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"manasseh-h4519g","name":"Manasseh","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":7}],"places":[{"id":"ammon-h5983","name":"Ammon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"gilead-h1568g","name":"Gilead","kind":"place","brief":"In Manasseh","count":3,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"jordan-h3383","name":"Jordan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":5}],"words":[{"base":"H0669","lemma":"אֶפְרַ֫יִם","tr":"eph·ra·yim","gloss":"Ephraim","lang":"h","inPassage":8,"uses":180},{"base":"H3316","lemma":"יִפְתָּח","tr":"yiph·tach","gloss":"Iphtah","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":30},{"base":"H1568","lemma":"גִּלְעָד","tr":"gil·ad","gloss":"Gilead","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":134},{"base":"H5983","lemma":"עַמּוֹן","tr":"am·mon","gloss":"Ammon","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":106},{"base":"H5674","lemma":"עָבַר","tr":"a·var","gloss":"to pass","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":556},{"base":"H3898","lemma":"לָחַם","tr":"la·cham","gloss":"to fight","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":177},{"base":"H4569","lemma":"מַעֲבָר","tr":"ma·a·var","gloss":"ford","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"H6412","lemma":"פָּלִיט","tr":"pa·lit","gloss":"survivor","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":24},{"base":"H0582","lemma":"אֱנוֹשׁ","tr":"e·nosh","gloss":"human","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":565},{"base":"H3383","lemma":"יַרְדֵּן","tr":"yar·den","gloss":"Jordan","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":182}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1SA","chapter":19,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"He took his life in his hands when he struck down the Philistine, and the LORD worked a great salvation for all Israel. You saw it and rejoiced, so why would you sin against innocent blood by killing David for no reason?”","from":3},{"book":"1SA","chapter":28,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"When the woman came to Saul and saw how distraught he was, she said to him, “Look, your maidservant has obeyed your voice. I took my life in my hands and did as you told me.","from":3},{"book":"JOB","chapter":13,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Why do I put myself at risk and take my life in my own hands?","from":3},{"book":"JDG","chapter":3,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"“Follow me,” he told them, “for the LORD has delivered your enemies the Moabites into your hand.” So they followed him down and seized the fords of the Jordan leading to Moab, and they did not allow anyone to cross over.","from":5},{"book":"JDG","chapter":8,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Then the men of Ephraim said to Gideon, “Why have you done this to us? Why did you fail to call us when you went to fight against Midian?” And they contended with him violently.","from":1},{"book":"PSA","chapter":119,"verse":109,"verseEnd":109,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"I constantly take my life in my hands, yet I do not forget Your law.","from":3},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Therefore tell the Israelites: ‘I am the LORD, and I will bring you out from under the yoke of the Egyptians and deliver you from their bondage. I will redeem you with an outstretched arm and with mighty acts of judgment.","from":6},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":37,"verseEnd":37,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the clans of Ephraim, and their registration numbered 32,500. These clans were the descendants of Joseph.","from":6}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"8-15":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":5,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"ibzan-h0078","name":"Ibzan","kind":"person","brief":"A Judge","count":2,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"elon-h0356j","name":"Elon","kind":"person","brief":"A Judge","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"zebulun-h2074","name":"Zebulun","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"abdon-h5658h","name":"Abdon","kind":"person","brief":"A Judge","count":2,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"hillel-h1985","name":"Hillel","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Abdon","count":2,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"ephraim-h0669g","name":"Ephraim","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":15}],"places":[{"id":"bethlehem-h1035g","name":"Bethlehem","kind":"place","brief":"In Judah","count":2,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"aijalon-h0357","name":"Aijalon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"pirathon-h6552","name":"Pirathon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"amalek-h6002g","name":"Amalek","kind":"place","brief":"In Edom","count":1,"firstVerse":15}],"words":[{"base":"H8199","lemma":"שָׁפַט","tr":"sha·phat","gloss":"to judge","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":202},{"base":"H1035","lemma":"בֵּית לֶ֫חֶם","tr":"bet le·chem","gloss":"Bethlehem","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":82},{"base":"H7970","lemma":"שְׁלֹשִׁים","tr":"she·lo·shim","gloss":"thirty","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":172},{"base":"H0078","lemma":"אִבְצָן","tr":"iv·tsan","gloss":"Ibzan","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H1985","lemma":"הִלֵּל","tr":"hil·lel","gloss":"Hillel","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H2075","lemma":"זְבוּלֹנִי","tr":"ze·vu·lo·ni","gloss":"Zebulunite","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":3},{"base":"H6553","lemma":"פִּרְעָתוֹנִי","tr":"pir·a·to·ni","gloss":"Pirathon","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":5},{"base":"H6912","lemma":"קָבַר","tr":"qa·var","gloss":"to bury","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":133},{"base":"H0356","lemma":"אֵלוֹן","tr":"e·lon","gloss":"Elon","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":7},{"base":"H5658","lemma":"עַבְדּוֹן","tr":"av·don","gloss":"Abdon","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"GEN","chapter":14,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then they turned back to invade En-mishpat (that is, Kadesh), and they conquered the whole territory of the Amalekites, as well as the Amorites who lived in Hazazon-tamar.","from":15},{"book":"GEN","chapter":15,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the land of the Kenites, Kenizzites, Kadmonites,","from":8},{"book":"EXO","chapter":17,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"After this, the Amalekites came and attacked the Israelites at Rephidim.","from":15},{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":42,"verseEnd":42,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Shaalabbin, Aijalon, Ithlah,","from":12},{"book":"JDG","chapter":3,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"After enlisting the Ammonites and Amalekites to join forces with him, Eglon attacked and defeated Israel, taking possession of the City of Palms.","from":15},{"book":"JDG","chapter":3,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"On arriving in Seirah, he blew the ramʼs horn throughout the hill country of Ephraim. The Israelites came down with him from the hills, and he became their leader.","from":15},{"book":"JDG","chapter":5,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"You who ride white donkeys, who sit on saddle blankets, and you who travel the road, ponder","from":14},{"book":"JDG","chapter":5,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Some came from Ephraim, with their roots in Amalek; Benjamin came with your people after you. The commanders came down from Machir, the bearers of the marshalʼs staff from Zebulun.","from":15}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]}}